WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.090 --> 00:00:01.750
- Many of my friends and other peers

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:02.840
are young professionals.

00:00:02.840 --> 00:00:04.710
They earn very decent salaries,

00:00:04.710 --> 00:00:06.410
though for a whole bunch of reasons,

00:00:06.410 --> 00:00:09.590
some of them just don't seem
to get their finances right.

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:11.470
They are part of a
phenomenon that is called

00:00:11.470 --> 00:00:13.350
high-income low net worth.

00:00:13.350 --> 00:00:15.870
Even though they earn
very comfortable salaries,

00:00:15.870 --> 00:00:18.000
they just don't know
how to invest properly,

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.740
they just don't know how to save,

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.080
and even though most of
them don't realize yet,

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:24.630
this will significantly
screw up their finances

00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:25.463
in the long-term.

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:27.980
In this video, we're going to
talk about all things money

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.760
and I'm talking about
a few principales that,

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.810
in my humble opinion, are
just extremely important

00:00:32.810 --> 00:00:34.400
for young professionals to follow.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.410
I want to pass on some
learnings and insights

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.280
from my business education and
from the research that I did

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.310
when I started earning my first salaries

00:00:41.310 --> 00:00:43.450
and asking myself how I
should invest the money,

00:00:43.450 --> 00:00:44.580
what I should do with it.

00:00:44.580 --> 00:00:46.000
Please be aware though that I am not

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:47.090
an investment professional

00:00:47.090 --> 00:00:48.640
and I need to give you the disclaimer

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.020
that I am not giving investment advice.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:00:52.310
Please do your own research

00:00:52.310 --> 00:00:55.050
before you invest your money
in any specific product.

